Changes made by Feida Wang: renamed to Context Forecast; extended the mod with
a transcript-based history backfill (hooks/history.ts), a forecast model and
formatters (hooks/forecast.ts), animated condition icons (hooks/sky.ts), a
forecast pane, minimize/hide modes and rate-limit/cost readouts; added tests,
documentation, a listing icon, and packaging for the Claude plugin directory.

